<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha Nehemia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Neh</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Ivitabu va Ezila na Nehemia vasimuila ivo Waizilaeli walekelwagwa kuuya Yelusalemu aho weze wande watahigwe na kwigalwa Uwajemi na Babeli. Nehemia alongesa mwe ivo luzengigwe uhya lukazi luzunguluke Yelusalemu. Wahinizi wengi wahuwila kugamba Ezila niye awandikaga na kuvidunganya simulizi ze vitabu ve Misimo ywa nk'hongo na ywa kaidi hamwenga ne vitabu va Ezila na Nehemia. Uneva handaga ni Ezila awandikaga yaoneka kugamba kwandaga mnt'hu mtuhu aviwandike ivi vitabu. Ikitabu cha Nehemia yadahaika nekilunganywa mwe mihilimo ya magana mane na milongo mitatu aho Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Nehemia andaga niye mndima ywo kumwigaila vo kunywa Atashasta, uyo seuta ywa Uwajemi. Nehemia amlombezaga amlekele auye Yelusalemu akambize kuzenga uhya lukazi lwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Seuta Atashasta amlekelaga Nehemia atende ivo, naho akajika amsagulaga Nehemia ande kilongozi ywa Uyahudi ne isi zikuzunguluka Yelusalemu. Mnango wa shano msitali wa mlongo na kane. Hata ivo want'hu wamwenga wagezaga kumhiga Nehemia ase kuzenga uhya lukazi lwa Yelusalemu, mna indima iyo yasilaga kwa mazuwa milongo mishano na maidi kwa wambizi wa Mnungu. Naho Ezila amwambizaga Nehemia kuwalongoza want'hu wa Izilaeli kudamanya uhya ndagano na Mnungu. Yemndani mwe kitabu cha Nehemia: 1 Nehemia auyaga Yelusalemu no kulongoza indima yo kuuzenga uhya lukazi lwa Yelusalemu. Mnango wa nk'hongo mpaka wa mtandatu 2 Waizilaeli wakongaga naho kwikala Yelusalemu na kutimila naho imiko ya Mnungu. Milango ya mfungate na mnango wa mlongo na mitatu,</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s">Undima wa Nehemia mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Ino niyo simo ya Nehemia mwana Hakalia, mkaya ywa Yelusalemu, umwo nandile mwo mzi mkulu wa Susa, mwo mwezi wa Kisilevu wo mwaka wa milongo miidi wo useuta wakwe Atashasita. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani yumwenga mwa wandugu zangu ezega na wamwenga kulawa mwe isi ya Yuda. Naho nehiwauza mwe mbuli ya weetu Wayahudi wahonile, awo wauyaga kulawa Babeli kwo utumwa ne mbuli yo mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Woho wanigambaga, “Wayahudi wahonaga na kuuya mwe isi yawe, we mwe makunt'ho na soni. Nk'handula zo mzi wa Yelusalemu zamokaga pele, zink'hili zakwe zokagwa.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Nize nive ayo nekalaga hasi na kuila, nahongezaga kwa mazuwa. Nafungaga na kumlombeza Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />hagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu, weye ywi Mnungu mkulu naho ywa kogohwa, watoza Ndagano yako na kulagisa lukunde lwako howiina uheelo kwa want'hu wose wakuzitoza sigilizi zako. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Nakulombeza unitegeleze, naho unikale miye mndima ywako, hakulombeza kwajili ya wandima wako kilo na msi. Nakweiila kwajili yo wavu wa want'hu wa Izilaeli. Miye hamwenga na want'hu wangu kizumila kugamba kidamanya wavu. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Kidamanya yaihise hako, hakitozile sigilizi zako, miko na malagizo yako umsigiile Musa mndima ywako. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Haluse kumbukila yadya umlagize mndima ywako Musa, wize ugambe uneva homnde wahuwilwa kwangu, neniwatendeni msambale mwe zi isi. <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />Mna mnauya kwangu na kutoza zisigilizi zangu na kuzitimila, hata uneva neni watendeni msambale hale, neni wavuzeni hant'hu nihasagule kunda hant'hu hangu ha kunivika.<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Want'hu awa ni wandima wako uwakombole kwa udahi wako mkulu na kwa ludole lwako. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Zumbe ywangu nakulombeza unitegeleze kiya hulombeza miye mndima ywako naho wandima wako wana kinyemi cha kukutunya weye. Nakulombeza unilagise uwedi wako dyelo, miye mndima ywako vileke seuta anionele mbazi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Miye nehinda na ndima ya kumwigaila vo kunywa seuta.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia aita Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Umwo ize yomboke miezi mine, mwezi ukwitangwa Nisani, mwo mwaka wa milongo miidi wo useuta wa Atashasta, umwo lwandaga lupisi lwa kwigala divai hakwe, naiguhaga na kumwigaila. Seuta hanati anione handa na kinyulu hakwe hata zuwa dimwenga uku haoneka kunda na kinyulu kitendese. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Seuta Atashasta aniuzaga, “Togola, nii waoneka kunda na kinyulu, nawe hwi mnyonge? Nakuona weye hiyo mnyonge, mna naona una kinyulu mwo moyo wako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Niho nogohesaga. <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Mna niyo namhitula, “Seuta wikalise! Nii nisekunda na kinyulu, umwo mzi wa Yelusalemu umwo vili vikuta va wakale wangu usigala hewiina kint'hu naho zink'hili zokigwa pele?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Niyo seuta Atashasta amhitula, “Haluse walombezai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Aho niyo namlombeza Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu mwo moyo wangu, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />hamgamba seuta, “Uneva seuta anelelwa na miye na kuzumila kunilekela, nakulombeza niite kwe isi ya Yuda vileke hauzenge uhya mzi uwo wandaga ne vikuta va wakale wangu.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Seuta niyo aniuza, mkaziwe akanda kekela hagihi naye, “Nounde uko kwa mazuwa mengahi naho nouuye ini aha?” Niyo namgambila lupisi neniuuye. Seuta niyo azumila.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Akajika niyo namlombeza seuta hamgamba, “Uneva yakwelela, nalombeza unink'he baluwa niigale kwa vilongozi we nt'hendelo ya usweelo wa zuwa ng'ambu yo mto Efulate, vileke wanizumile nombokele mwe isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Naho nakulombeza unink'he baluwa iyo awandikilwe Asafu mwamizi ywe mbago ye kiseuta vileke anink'he miti yo kudamanyila mikimaila ye nk'hili ye digomela dye Nyumbaya Mnungu, na kwajili yo lukazi lwo mzi ne nyumba yangu umwo nenikale.” Seuta anink'haga kila icho nalombeze kwaviya Mnungu amtendaga anizumile. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Seuta awasigiilaga wakulu we difyo dya watowani na wakugendeza zifalasi kiitanye. Nize niwabwiile wakulu we isi ya usweelo wa zuwa yo mto Efulate, nawenk'haga ibaluwa ya seuta.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Mna Sanibalati kulawa mzi wa Beti holoni, na Tobia kilongozi ywa Waamoni na mndima ywakwe, weze weve kugamba hiza vileke kuwatendela ayedi want'hu wa Izilaeli, woho hawelelwe ne mbuli iyo.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Nize nibule Yelusalemu niyo nekala uko kwa mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Umwo nekilo miyo nahalwaga na want'hu wageke du. Hyagambilag mnt'hu yeyose kiya Mnungu aikile mwo moyo wangu cho kuudamanyila mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Kilo iicho nafosaga kwombokela kwe nk'hili ya kwe Dikolongo niyo nombokela kwe disima dikwitangwa Dizoka mpaka kwe nk'hili ye Nt'hagata, na kululaula Lukazi lo mzi wa Yelusalemu ulo lwandile lumoka hamwenga ne zink'hili zakwe izo zandile zokigwa. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Niyo naita mpaka kwe nk'hili ya nc'hoko na kwe dikawa dya seuta. Mna idya imp'hunda naigendezaga hayadahaga komboka kwajili ye kilundo cha mank'halank'hala. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Mwo lupisi lwa nekilo, nombokelaga mwe Dikolongo dyo mto Kidiloni na kulaula lukazi. Nauyaga naho ne sila iidya nezaga nayo kombokela kwe Nk'hili ya kwe Dikolongo. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Wakulu hawamanyaga hant'hu naitile hegu icho nadamanye. Naho hya wagambile Wayahudi, hegu walavant'hambiko hegu vilongozi na wakulu, hata want'hu wakuunga wadamanye ndima.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Niyo nawagamba, “Togoleni mwaona makunt'ho kinanayo kugamba mzi wa Yelusalemu unda mahame du, naho zink'hili zakwe zokigwa pele! Haluse kiteni kikazenge naho lukazi lwo mzi wa Yelusalemu veleke kisekunda na soni naho.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Naho nawagambilaga ivo Mnungu andile hamwenga na miye na kunidamanyila uwedi wakwe, na ivo seuta anigambilaga. Woho weze weve ayo, wagambaga, “Ni vedi, kikongeni ndima ya uzesi.” Ivo niyo wakeika lumwe kwa ndima iyo iyedi.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Mna Sani balati na Tobia, na Mwalabu akwitangwa Geshemu weze weve mbuli iyo, wakisekaga na kukibela wakagamba, “Ni kint'hu chani iki mkudamanya? Togoleni mwaunga msaguke kwa seuta?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Niyo nawahitula, “Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu naachambize kidahe kuidamanya indima ino. Suwe wandima wakwe nekikonge uzesi. Mna nyuwe homnde na ukipe wowose hegu uwagilwa hegu nk'humbukila mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu?”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Lukazi lwa Yelusalemu lwazengwa uhya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Ivi nivo lukzi lwo mzi lwazengwagwa: Eliashibu mlavant'hambiko mkulu hamwenga na walavant'hambiko weyawe watuhu wazengaga uhya he Nk'hili ye Ngoto. Wahaikaga kwajili ya Mnungu niyo wagele ne zinyivi zakwe, wzwngwaga naho mpaka kwo Mnala wa Gana dimwenga na komnala wa Hanaeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Hant'hu hatimile hazengwagwa naho na want'hu wa Yeliko. Zakuli mwana ywa Nimli niyo azenga hant'hu hatimile.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Nk'hili ya Samaki izengwa uhya ni lukolo lwa Hasena, waikaga mkimailo yakwe ne zinyivi zakwe, mitunga mikulu na mihindo ya kilama. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Hant'hu hatimile hazengagwa uhya ni Melemoti mwana Ulia uyoi mwezukuluwe dya Hakosi. Hatuhu hatimile hazengagwa uhya ni Meshulamu, mwana Belekia mwana Meshezabeli. Hant'hu hatimile hazengagwa uhya ni Sadoki, na mwana Baana. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Hant'hu hatimile hazengagwa ni want'hu kulawa mwo mzi wa Tekoa. Mna vilongozi wo mzi walemelaga kudamanya ndima izo wenk'higwe ni wakimalizi vileke wazidamanye.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Nk'hili yetangwagwa Nk'hili ya Kale yazengagwa naho na Yoyada mwana Pasea hamwenga na Meshulamu mwana Besodeya. Waikaga mikimailo ne mitunga mikulu, mihindo yakwe ya kilama. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Watimilaga mwe ndima yo kuzenga naho wandaga ni Melatia kulawa Gibeoni na Yadoni kulawa Melonoti hamwenga na want'hu wo mzi wa Gibeoni na Mizipa wandaga mwo udahi wo mkowa wa usweelo wa zuwa wo mto Efulate.<verse eid="NEH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Hatuhu hatimile hazengwagwa naho ni Uzieli mwana Halikaya, msani ywe zahabu. Hant'hu hatimilaga mpaka kwo lukazi luzangalamu lwazengwagwa naho ni Hanania mdamanyi wo mhemp'he.<verse eid="NEH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Lefai mwana Huli mkulu ywe nusu yo mzi wa Yelusalemu, niye azengaga naho hant'hu hatimile.<verse eid="NEH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Yedaya mwana Halumafu azengaga naho hant'hu hatimilaga handaga hagihi ne nyumba yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:10">Hatimilaga hatuhu hazengagwa naho ni Hatushi mwana Hashabineya.<verse eid="NEH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Hant'hu hatimilaga hamwenga no mnala we nunda yo kokela mikate, yazengagwa naho ni Malikiya mwana Halimu hamwenga na Hashubu mwana Pahati Mmoabu.<verse eid="NEH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Hant'hu hatuhu hatimile hazengagwa naho na Shalumu mwana Haloheshi, kilongozi we nusu int'huhu ya Yelusalemu. Akambizana na wanakike wakwe mwo uzesi uwo.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Nk'hili ye kwe Dikolongo yazengagwa ni Hanuni hamwenga na wakaya wo mzi wa Zanoa. Na kuwiika ink'hili hant'hu hakwe, niyo waugela mhindo wakwe. Wazengaga naho lukazi lwandaga na utali wa mita magana mane mpaka mwe Nk'hili ye Nt'hagata.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Nk'hili ya Nt'hagata yazengagwa naho ni Makia mwana Lekabu mkulu ywe wilaya ya Beti Hakelemu. Aizengaga uhya na kugela zinyivi zakwe ne madanaga yakwe ne mihindo yakwe.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Mwingiilo we zinc'hoko yazengagwa naho ni Shalumu mwana Kolihoze mkulu ywa Mizipa. Aiikaga hant'hu hakwe na kuitima, niyo aiikila mihindo ya kilama, na mitunga mikulu. Kwe dikawa dya Shela azengaga lukazi mpaka kwe kiunga che kiseuta na kugendeela kwe vibo vikuhinga kwo mzi wa Daudi. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Hant'hu hakutimila mpaka kwe vikuta va mzi wa Daudi, na kwe dikawa na kwe nk'hambi ya watowani vazengagwa naho ni Nehemia mwana Azibuki mkulu ywe nusu ye wilaya ya Beti suli.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walawi wazengile lukazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Eze ajike uyo, Walawi wagendeelaga kuzenga wandaga, Lehumu mwana Bani. Hashabia kilongozi ywe nusu ya Keila naye aizengaga naho hant'hu hatimile haungwagwa hazengigwe ni want'hu we wilaya yakwe.<verse eid="NEH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Bavai mwana Henadadi kilongozi ywe nusu int'huhu ye wilaya ya Keila azengaga hant'hu hatimile.<verse eid="NEH 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Hant'hu hakutimila ho lukazi, hakukaulana ne nyumba yo kuikila vitowanilo va nk'hondo mpaka kwe mp'hembe yo lukazi lwazengagwa naho na Ezeli mwana Yeshua kilongozi ywa Mizipa.<verse eid="NEH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Hant'hu hatimilaga kukongela kwe mp'hembe yo lukazi kuhinga kwo mwingiilo we nyumba ya Eliashibu mlavant'hambiko mkulu yazengwagwa naho ni Baluku mwana Zabai.<verse eid="NEH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Hant'hu hatimilaga mpaka kwo uheelo we nyumba ya Eliashibu hazengwagwa naho ni Melemoti mwana Ulia mwezukuluwe dya Hakosi.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walavant'hambiko wazengaga lukazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Hant'hu hatimilaga hazengwagwa naho ni walavant'hambiko kulawa mwe zint'hendelo zimgihi no mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Benjamini na Hashubu wazengaga naho hant'hu hakutimila hagihi ne zinyumba zawe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Uzia mwana Maseya mwezukuluwe dya Anania azengaga naho hant'hu hatimile ho lukazi hagihi ne nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="NEH 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Hant'hu hakutimila ni kukongela mwe nyumba ya Uzia mpaka kwe mp'hembe ye lukazi hazengwagwa ni Binui mwana Henadadi.<verse eid="NEH 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Hant'hu hakutimila kukongela mwe mp'hembe ya lukazi mpaka kwo mnala mtali we nyumba ye seuta hagihi no kigela cha wamizi, hazengwagwa naho ni Palali mwana Uzai, Pedaya mwana Paloshi.<verse eid="NEH 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Pedaya mwana Paloshi naye hamwenga na wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu wakwikala kwa kagulu ka Ofeli, wazengaga naho hant'hu hatimile hant'hu hakukaulana ne Nk'hili ya Mazi, nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa wo mnala mtali.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazesi watuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Hant'hu hatimilaga ni kukongela mwo mnala mtali mpaka kwo lukazi lwa Ofeli, hazengagwa naho ni wakaya wo mzi wa Tekoa.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Kukongela kwe Nk'hili ye Falasi kwandaga na walavant'hambiko kila yumwenga akazenga hant'hu hakukaulana ne nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="NEH 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Sadoki mwana Imeli azengaga naho hant'hu hatimilaga hakukaulana ne nyumba yakwe. Shemaya mwana Shekania mwamizi ywe Nk'hili yo Ulailo wa zuwa azengaga hant'hu hatimilaga.<verse eid="NEH 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Hant'hu hatimilaga hazengagwa naho ni Hanania mwana Shelemia, akanda hamwenga na Hanuni mwana ywa mtandatu ywa Zalafu. Aha ni hant'hu hawe ha kaidi mwo kuzenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:30">Meshulamu mwana Belekia naye azengaga naho hant'hu hatimilaga hakukaulana ne nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="NEH 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Makia msana zahabu azengaga hant'hu hakutimila mpaka kwe nyumba wekalaga wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu hamwenga na wachuuzi yandaga hagihi ne Nk'hili yo Kulauila, hagihi ne chumba cha kulanga mwe mp'hembe hant'hu ha mkomamahanya na ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="NEH 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Wasana zahabu watuhu na wachuuzi watuhu wazengaga naho hant'hu ho kubindiliza kulawa kwe chumba mpaka kwe Nk'hili ya Ngoto.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia auhuma uhigani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Sanibalati eze eve kugamba kikonga naho kuzenga lukazi, aihiyagwa vitendese, niyo akonga kukibela, <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />halongole ha wambwiyaze na ha watowani wa Wasamalia akagamba, “Awa Wayahudi wasokezi watendai aha? Togola fanyanyi yawe ni kuuzenga mzi naho? Togola wafanyanya kwa kulava nt'hambiko nawadahe kubinda ndima kwa zuwa dimwenga du? Nawadahe kuyatenda maiwe ya mwe mazala yakudaha kuzengela?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobia kulawa kwe isi ya Waamoni akimalaga hagihi naye niyo agamba, “Wazengai? Hata uzi dinakweela umo dyadaha du kumola lukazi lwawe lwa maiwe!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Naho namlombezaga Mnungu hagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu ywetu, Tegeleza ivo wakukibela, uwavuzile mabelo ayo kwakwe wenye na uwaleke watahigwe mwe isi ya watahigwa. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Naho unase kuwalekela masa yawe hegu unase kujala wavu wawe kwaviya wakihomola suwe wazesi wako.”<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Ivo kigendeela kiluzenga lukazi mpaka mwe nusu yo utali kuita kulanga kwaviya want'hu wagendeela kuuzenga kwa mioyo yawe.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Mna umwo Sanibalati na Tobia na Waalabu na Waamoni na Waashidodi weze weve kugamba ndima yo kuzenga lukazi lwa Yelusalemu wagendeela, naho hahana hohose hehezengigwe uhya, waihiyagwa vitendese. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Waikaga mzungu kwiza Yelusalemu kuutowa na kwigala nt'hulumundu. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Ivo chamlombezaga Mnungu ywetu naho nekiika wamizi kilo na msi.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Want'hu wa Yuda wakongaga kukema wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">“Wazesi wo lukazi wahungukilwa ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">naho kuna mank'halank'hala yabindile wingi ya kwinula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 4:10">Nekidahe vivihi kuluzenga lukazi?”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Naho wank'hondo wetu wandaga wakagamba, “Hawadahe kumanya hegu kuona, mpaka kize kibule kwawe na kuwakoma na kukindila indima.”<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Wayahudi wekalaga hagihi na wank'hondo wetu weze weve mbuli izo, wezaga nk'hanana nyingi kukikanya wakagamba, “Wank'hondo wetu naweze kulawa nt'hendelo zose wakitowe.”<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Ivo kundya kunyuma kwandaga no lukazi luguhi na kila hant'hu handaga hakei kusila, napangaga want'hu viligane ne zink'holo zawe wakanda na sime na mijungo na nyuta. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Nize nione kugamba want'hu wogohesa, nakimalaga niyo nawagamba wakulu ne vilongozi wose wa want'hu, “Mse kogoha. Kumbukileni ivo Zumbe Mnungu eli mkulu na wa kogohwa, na ivo towaneni kwaajili ya wandugu zenyu, na wana wenyu na wavele wenyu ne zikaya zenyu.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Wank'hondo weze weve kugamba fanyanyi zawe kizibunk'hula naho Mnungu abanangaga fanyanyi zawe, niho suwe chose chauyaga kiluzenge naho lukazi.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Kukongela mwe dizuwa idyo na kugendeela, nusu ya wandima wangu wagendeelaga no uzesi na inusu int'huhu ni kwaajili yo wamizi wakanda ne mijungo na nk'hindo na nyuta na mavalo ya kukindila kifua. Vilongozi wetu wandaga wakawagela moyo want'hu wa Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />awo wandile wakazenga lukazi. Hata wadya nawekenula vint'hu va kuzengela wazengaga no mkono umwenga, mkono mtuhu nawo ukanda utoza vitowanilo. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Kila mzesi andaga ne sime yakwe inyinyigwe mwe kigudi na akagendeela kuzenga, mnt'hu akutowa digunda naye andaga hagihi na miye.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Nawagambaga wakulu na want'hu wose kwa hamwenga, “Lukazi ulu lutendesa utali, naho lukitenda kisambale kila mnt'hu ehale na miyawe. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Umwo ukadamanya ndima niyo weva izwi dya gunda, gulukila kwetu. Mnungu ywetu naakitowanile!”<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Ivo chagendeelaga kudamanya ndima ne nusu ya want'hu wetu wenulaga vitowanilo va nk'hondo kukongela kilokilo mpaka nekilo zint'hondo zikaoneka kwe mbingu.<verse eid="NEH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Mwo lupisi ulwo niyo nawagamba want'hu, “Kila mgosi na mndima ywakwe neekale Yelusalemu nekilo, vileke kinde na wamizi wa nekilo, na mwo lupisi lwa msi nawagendeele na ndima.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Ivo miye na wandugu zangu na wandima wangu hata wamizi wandile hamwenga na miye, hachahambulaga zisuke zetu, kila yumwenga ywetu hachahambulaga suke zetu mazuwa yose.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemia awambiza wakiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Niyo kwalaila nk'halalizi kwa want'hu, wagosi kwa wavele wakawakalaliza wandugu zawe Wayahudi. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Wamwenga wagambaga, “Kina mp'huga nk'hulu kwaivo chaunga nk'hande kidye kise kubanika.”<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Watuhu nao wagambaga, “Kiikiza nk'honde zetu za mizabibu ne zinyumba zetu kwa wagoli, vileke kipate nk'hande digumbo.”<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Watuhu nao walabilaga wakagamba, “Vaungwa kikakope matundu vileke kilihile kodi ya seuta mwe nk'honde zetu na mwe mizabibu yetu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Mna suwe ni enga du Wayahudi watuhu, wana wetu ni enga wana wawe. Hata ivi chatigizwa kuwatenda wana wetu kunda watumwa. Wamwenga mwa wanakike wetu wanda kale watumwa. Hakina udahi wa kukindila mbuli ino kwaviya kihokigwa nk'honde zetu ni want'hu watuhu.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Nize nive kulabila kwawe naihiyagwa vitendese. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Niho nafanyanyaga kuwakanya vilongozi na wakulu hawagamba, “Mwawatoza matundu ya kusump'hula wandugu zenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:7">Netangaga mdugano wa want'hu wose kilonge mwe mbuli ino <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />hagamba, “Viligane no udahi kinanao, chandaga kikawagula naho wandugu zetu Wayahudi wandaga watagigwa kwa want'hu wa si nt'huhu. Mna hata ivi haluse mwawatenda wandugu zenyu kunda watumwa wenyu!” Aho niyo vilongozi wanyamala haweina dyo kuhitula.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Niyo nawagamba, “Mbuli mkudamanya hiyo yedi. Chaungwa kudamanya yakumwelela Mnungu ywetu na kudamanya yawagilwe. Kwa kutenda ivo wank'hondo wetu hi Wayahudi hawa kibele. <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Naho, miye mwenye na wandugu zangu na wandima wangu neki wakopeshe wandugu zetu matundu na nk'hande. Naho hekiguhe chochose kikusump'hula. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Msunguze dielo idi muwavuzile zink'honde zawe ze mizabibu na ze mizeituni na nyumba zawe na matundu yakusump'hula, unga na mavuta ayo nandile hawatigizani.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Woho niyo wahitula wakagamba, “Nekiwavuzile naho hekiwatigize wakilihe chochose. Nekidamanye enga ivo ulongile.” Nawetangaga walavant'hambiko na kuwatenda vilongozi wose waike kilapi ho undiilo wa walavant'hambiko kugamba nawa tende enga ivo walagane. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Naho nakung'unt'haga msipi wangu wa mwe kigudi niyo nagamba, “Ivi nivo Mnungu naamkungunt'he nyumba na viya ananvo yeyose heekukint'hiza lagano dyakwe, naatoigwe na kumfoseza mwe nyumba yakwe. Ivo naande hana kint'hu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Want'hu wose niyo wazumila wakagamba, “Taile.” Naho want'hu awo wamtunyaga Zumbe Mnungu. Want'hu niyo watenda enga ivo walagane.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukise wa Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kukongela aho nasagulwe kunda kilongozi ywe isi ya Yuda, kwa lupisi lwa miyaka mlongo na mbili kukongela mwo mwaka wa milongo miidi mpaka mwo mwaka wa milongo mitatu na miidi yo useuta wa Atashata, hyadaga nk'hande naungagwa kwink'higwa enga kilongozi, hegu ndugu zangu hawatendaga ivo. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Vilongozi wanilongoele wandaga nt'wika kwa want'hu wakatigiza nk'hande na divai, na kuwaunga wawalihe vibesu milongo mine va masawa kila zuwa hata wandima wawe wawatigizaga want'hu. Mna miye hidamanye ivo, kwaviya namtunya Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Nehinda nakombatizaga kwa ndima ya uzesi we lukazi, naho hyakepatile nk'honde ya mnt'hu uyo adunduge kuliha. Hata wandima wangu wadamanyaga ndima kwa kukombatiza.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Kila zuwa, nawenk'haga nk'hande want'hu gana dimwenga na milongo mishano wakanda Wayahudi na wakulu naho kwandaga na want'hu wezile kulawa kwe isi zint'huhu kuchambiza. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Kila zuwa, nawenk'haga nk'hande want'hu awo, nawenk'haga na nyama ya jeku dimwenga na ngoto zedi mtandatu na nguku nyingi. Kila zuwa dya mlongo nalavaga divai ihengi. Mna namanyaga want'hu wana nt'wika nt'huhu, ivo hyaungaga maliho heye wagilwe kwangu.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Weye Mnungu ywangu nikumbukile uwedi wangu mwe kila kint'hu nidamanye kwa want'hu awa.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Mzungu wa kumkoma Nehemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanibalati na Tobia na Geshemu, akwitangwa Mwalabu na wank'hondo wetu watuhu, weze weve kibinda uzesi wo lukazi naho na kugamba hahana hohose halekigwe hamwenga na kugamba hakinati kugela zinyivi kwe mingiilo. <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu watumaga ulosi kwangu wakagamba, “Soo kidugane mwo mzi umwenga we nt'hindiga ya Ono. Mna uno nounda mnyanyiko wa kunikoma.” <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Ivo, nawegailaga ulosi hagamba, “Ndima hudamanya haikuungwa kuswesa. Ivo hikudaha kugenda kuikimalisa vileke nize kwenyu.”<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Wanigailaga ulosi uwo nk'hanana nne, name kwa nk'hanana nne nawenk'haga uhituzi uudya nawahitulaga.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Nk'hanana ya shano Sanibalati asigiilaga yumwenga mwa wandima wakwe kwangu andaga ne baluwa yadahaga kusomigwa ni mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Naho baluwa yenye yawandikwagwa ivi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:6">“Geshemu agamba mwe isi mwivika dihambwehambwe, kugamba weye na Wayahudi weyawo mwaunga msaguke. Nivo vikuleka mwaluzenga naho lukazi. Naho weye waika mnyanyiko wa kuketenda mwenye kunda seuta ywawe. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Naho kukeikila walavant'hambiko mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu vileke wabwelekeze kugamba weye ywi seuta ywe isi ya Yuda. Seuta Atashasta naagambilwe zimbuli izi, ivo nafanyanya kidugane vileke kisimuile mwe mbuli ino.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Name niyo namhitula kugamba. “Ayo ukulonga hiyo ya kindedi, ayo kutunga mwenye.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Wadamanyaga ivo vileke wakitise wakafanyanya kugamba, nekinde wasokezi mwe ndima, kwaivo indima heisile. Name niyo namlombeza Zumbe Mnungu ywangu hagamba, “Weye, Mnungu ywangu nakulombeza unink'he ludole.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Zuwa dimwenga nize niite kaya kwa Shemaya mwana Delaya na mwezukuluwe Mehetabeli uyo heekulekelwa kufosa kuse, anigambaga, “Kite kibwiilane kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu kikakefise, naho nyivi zakwe kizivugale kwaviya kilo cha dielo naweze wakukome.” <verse eid="NEH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Mna miye niyo namhitula, “Togoleni mnt'hu enga miye adaha kunyilika na kukefisa? Wafanyanya kugamba miye nadaha kwingila mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu vileke niyokole wikazi wangu? Bule! Henidahe kudamanya ivo.” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Nize nifanyanye vedi nabunk'hulaga kugamba Mnungu halongile na Sanibalati, vituhu vakwe Tobia na Sanibalati wamfumbasaga, vileke anigambile mbuli izi. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Nakafumbaswa vileke anitise vileke miye nitende wavu. Vileke wande na luneka lwa kubalanga zina dyangu na kuwatenda want'hu wanibele.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Namlombezaga Mnungu hagamba, “Mnungu kumbukila yadya watendile Tobia na Sanibalati, hamwenga na yudya mlotezi mvele Noadia na walotezi watuhu awo wagezaga kunitisa.”<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndima yakint'ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Ivo ndima yo uzesi yasilaga mwe dizuwa dya milongo miidi na mishano yo mwezi ukwitangwa Eluli, ndima iyo yaguhaga mazuwa milongo mishano na maidi niyo yasila.<verse eid="NEH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Wank'hondo wetu mwe isi zikukizunguluka weze weve kugamba kiibinda indima, wogohaga na kukeiva soni, kwaviya wamanyaga kugamba ndima yajika kwa wambizi wa Mnungu.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Naho mwa mazuwa ayo yose, vilongozi wa Wayahudi wandaga wakawandikilana baluwa na Tobia. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Want'hu wengi mwa Wayahudi wandaga ywawe kwaviya andaga mkwewe ywa Shekania, mwana Ala. Naho Yehohanani mwana Tobia amlombaga mwana Meshulamu uyo mwana Belekia. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Naho nawakanigambila ayedi adamanye, na kumwigaila zimbuli zangu. Tobia naye andaga akanigaila baluwa nyingi za kugeza kunitisa.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Aho ndima yo uzesi wo lukazi ize yajike nagelaga zinyivi, niyo naika wamizi we zink'hili, wakemi na Walawi watuhu nawo nawenk'haga ndima iyo waungwagwa wadamanye. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Nasagulaga want'hu waidi walongoze Yelusalemu awo Hanani ndugu ywangu na Hanania uyo andaga mkulu ywe digomela mwe Yelusalemu kwaviya andaga mnt'hu mhuilwa naho akumvika Mnungu, hakwandaga na mtuhu enga yehe. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Niyo nawagamba, “Zink'hili za Yelusalemu zisekukomolwa kilo chose mpaka zuwa dikakwela. Aho wamizi wakanda wakei kuhalawa, zink'hili zose zivugalwe ne mihindo yakwe. Saguleni wamizi mwa wakaya wa Yelusalemu, kila yumwenga ande hant'hu hakwe watuhu nawo wamile hagihi ne zinyumba zawe.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludongo lwa want'hu wauyaga kulawa kwo utumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Mzi wa Yelusalemu wandaga mkulu, mna wakaya wakwe wandaga wageke naho zinyumba zakwe zandaga zikei kuzengigwa. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Mnungu aikaga mwo moyo wangu kuunga kuwaduganya want'hu na vilongozi vileke kimanye nk'holo zawe na kupata kina mazina ya want'hu wauiye kulawa kwo utahigwa aho nk'hongo. Naho want'hu awa nawo wawandikwe mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Wadya wandaga mwo utumwa kudya Babeli, wauyaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu na mwe isi ya Yuda, kila yumwenga auyaga mwe kaya yakwe. Nk'holo zawe zandaga zikekala mwe isi za watakwiza uko Babeli kukongela mwo useuta wa Nebukaduleza uko awaguhaga watahigwa. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Weze wauye walongozagwa na Zelubabeli na Yoshua na Nehemia na Uzia na Laamia na Nahamani na Modekai na Bilishani na Misipeleti na Bigivai na Nehumu na Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Ulu nulo ludongo lwe zink'holo za Izilaeli zauyaga kulawa kwo utumwa.<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Lukolo lwa Paloshi wandaga alufu mbili na gana dimwenga na milongo mfungate na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />lukolo lwa Shefatia magana matatu na milongo mfungate na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />lukolo lwa Ala magana mtandatu na milongo mishano na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />lukolo lwa Pahati Mmoabu awo welekwa wa Yoshua na Yoabu alufu mbili na milongo mnane na gana dimwenga na mnane, <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />lukolo lwa Elamu alufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mishano na wane, <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />lukolo lwa Zatu, alufu mnane na magana mane na milongo mishano, <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />lukolo lwa Zakai magana mfungate na milongo mtandatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />lukolo lwa Binui magana mtandatu na milongo mine na mnane, <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />lukolo lwa Bebai magana mtandatu na milongo miidi na wane, <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />lukolo lwa Azigadi, alufu mbili na milongo magana matatu na milongo miidi na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />lukolo lwa Adonikamu magana mtandatu na milongo mtandatu na mfungate, <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />lukolo lwa Bigivai alufu mbili na milongo mtandatu na mfungate, <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />lukolo lwa Adini magana mtandatu na milongo mishano na washano, <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />lukolo lwa Ateli awo iviya iviya lwetangwa Hezikia, milongo kenda na mnane, <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />lukolo lwa Hashumu magana matatu na milongo miidi na mnane, <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />lukolo lwa Bezai magana matatu na milongo miidi na wane, <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />lukolo lwa Halifu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />lukolo lwa Gibeoni milongo kenda na mishano. <verse eid="NEH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Na want'hu we mizi mituhu wauyaga. Wa mzi wa Betelehemu na Netofa, gana dimwenga na milongo mnane na wane, <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />want'hu wo mzi wa Anatoti, gana dimwenga na milongo miidi na mnane, <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />want'hu wo mzi wa Bet Azimaweti, milongo mine na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />want'hu wo mzi wa Kiliati Yealimu na Kefila na Beeloti, magana mfungate na milongo mine na watatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />want'hu wo mzi wa Lama na Geba, magana mtandatu na milongo miidi na yumwenga, <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />want'hu wo mzi wa mikimashi gana dimwenga na milongo miidi na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />want'hu wo mzi wa Beteli na Ai gana dimwenga na milongo miidi na watatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />want'hu wo mzi mtuhu wa Nebo milongo mishano na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />want'hu wo mzi mtuhu wa Elamu, alufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mishano na wane, <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />want'hu wo mzi wa Halimu, magana matatu na milongo waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />want'hu wo mzi wa Yeliko, magana matatu na milongo mine na washano, <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />want'hu wo mzi wa Lodi na Hadidi na Ono, magana mfungate na milongo miidi na umwenga, <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />want'hu mzi wa Senaa, alufu nt'hatu na magana kenda na milongo mitatu.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Ulu nulo ludongo lwa walavant'hambiko wauyaga kulawa kwo utahigwa. Walavant'hambiko wo lukolo lwa Yedaya, wandaga wa cheleko cha Yeshua magana kenda na mfungate na watatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />walavant'hambiko wo lukolo lwa Imeli, alufu imwenga na milongo mishano na waidi, <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />walavant'hambiko wo lukolo lwa Pashuli, alufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mine na mfungate, <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />walavant'hambiko wo lukolo lwa Halimu, alufu imwenga na mlongo umwenga na mfungate, <verse eid="NEH 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Walawi wauyaga kulawa mwo utahigwa wandaga ni kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Yeshua na Kadimieli welekwa wa Hodavia, wandaga milongo mfungate na wane. <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Wakemi awo welekwa wa Asafu wandaga gana dimwenga na milongo mine na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu kulawa mwo welekwa wa Shalumu na Ateli na Talmoni na Akubu na Hatita na Shobai wandaga gana dimwenga na milongo mitatu na mnane.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Nk'holo za wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu wauyaga kulawa mwo utahigwa zandaga ni za Ziha na Hasafa na Tabaoti, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />lukolo lwa Kelosi na Siaha na Padoni, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />lukolo lwa Lebana na Hagaba na Shalimai, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />lukolo lwa Hanani na Gideli na Gahali, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />lukolo lwa Leaya na Lesini na Nekoda, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />lukolo lwa Gazamu na Uza na Pasea, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />lukolo lwa Besai na Meunimu na Nefushesimu, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />lukolo lwa Bakubuki na Hakufa na Halihuli, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />lukolo lwa Basiluti na na lukolo lwa Mehida na na lukolo lwa Halishu, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />lukolo lwa Balikosi na na lukolo lwa Sisela na na lukolo lwa Tema, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />lukolo lwa Nezia na lukolo lwa Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Nk'holo za wandima wa seuta Selemani wauyaga kulawa mwo utumwa zandaga za lukolo lwa Sotai na lukolo lwa Sofeleti na lukolo lwa Pelida, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />na lukolo lwa Yaala na lukolo lwa Dalikoni na lukolo lwa Gideli, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />na lukolo lwa Shefatia na lukolo lwa Hatili na lukolo lwa Pokeleti, Hasebaimu na lukolo lwa Amoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Ivo wandima wose we Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu na welekwa wa wandima wa Selemani, wauyaga kulawa mwo utumwa wandaga magana matatu na milongo kenda na waidi.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Mizi ya Teli Mela na wa Teli Halishu, na wa Kelubu na wa Adoni na wa Imeli, mna hawadahaga kukelavanya kugamba wandaga welekwa wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Welekwa wa Delaya na Tobia na wa Nekoda, nawanda want'hu magana mtandatu na milongo mine na waidi. <verse eid="NEH 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Welekwa wakutimila wauyaga kulawa mwo utumwa nk'holo zawe hazaonekaga. Lukolo lwa Hobaya na wa Hakozi na wa Balizilai uyo andaga kalomba mwana Balizilai Mgileadi, na niyo aguha zina dya lukolo ulo.<verse eid="NEH 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Awo wazungulaga mazina yawe mwa watuhu wawandikwagwa mwe nk'humbukila ye zink'holo, mna lukolo lwawe halwandile umo, kwaivo hawazumilagwa kuikwa mwo undima wo ulavant'hambiko. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Kilongozi amgambaga kugamba hawakuzumilwa kudya nk'hande ikukile, mpaka mlava nt'hambiko mta ulamuzi wa Ulimu na Thumuni eze.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Want'hu wose wauyaga kulawa mwo utahigwa wandaga alufu milongo mine na waidi na magana matatu na milongo mtandatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Kwandaga na wandima wagosi na wavele alufu mfungate na magana matatu na milongo mitatu na mfungate. Naho kwandaga na wakemi wagosi na wavele wose wandaga magana maidi na milongo mine na shano. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Kwandaga falasi magana mfungate milongo mitatu na mtandatu na mph'unda falasi magana maidi na milongo mine na shano, <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />naho kwanda ngamia magana mane na milongo mitatu na shano na mp'hunda alufu mtandatu na magana mfungate na milongo miidi.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Wamwenga mwe vilongozi we zink'holo walavaga vint'hu kwajili ye ndima yo kuzenga uhya Nyumba ya Mnungu. Miye Nehemia mkulu ywo mkoa nalavaga kilo mnane za zahabu na nyiga milongo mishano na mavalo ya walava nt'hambiko magana mashano na milongo mitatu. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Naho wamwenga mwa wakulu we zink'holo walavaga kilo gana dimwenga na milongo mtandatu na mnane ya zahabu, na kilo alufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mishano ya masawa. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Vint'hu vose vilavigwe na want'hu watuhu wose vandaga ni kilo gana dimwenga na milongo mtandatu na mnane za zahabu na kilo gana dimwenga na milongo mine ya masawa na mavalo ya walavant'hambiko milongo mtandatu na mfungate.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Ivo walavant'hambiko na Walawi na wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu, na wakemi na want'hu watuhu na wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wekalaga mwe mizi yawe.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ezila awasomela want'hu Imiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Umwo wize ubule mwezi wa mfungate want'hu wose wa Izilaeli waduganaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu ho lwazo lwi hagihi no Nk'hili yo Mazi. Niyo wamgamba Ezila mlavant'hambiko naho mwandisi, akilete kitabu che Miko ya Musa iyo Zumbe Mnungu awenk'haga want'hu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Ezila akiletaga kitabu icho che Miko ya Musa he difyo dya want'hu, wagosi na wavele na wana wadahaga kukombaganya iyo Imiko. Zuwa idyo dyandaga dya nk'hongo dyo mwezi wa mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Ivo Ezila awasomelaga imiko ya Musa akanda he Nk'hili yo Mazi kukongela mtondo mpaka nomsi. Want'hu wose wategelezaga kwa wengele icho kiwandikwe mwe kitabu che Miko.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ezila uyo mwandisi andaga kakimala halongole hant'hu henukile hatile kudamanyanywa kwa mbao kwajili ye mbuli iyo, kulume kwakwe wakimalaga Matisia na Shema na Anaya na Ulia na Hilikia na Maseya, kumoso kwakwe nako wakimalaga Pedaya na Mishaeli na Makiya na Hashumu na Hashibadana na Zekalia na Meshulamu.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ezila akimalaga he kilingo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 8:5">ha want'hu wose, awo want'hu wose wamkaulaga. Ezila eze agubule kitabu che Miko want'hu wose wakimalaga kwa kumtunya Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ezila niyo agamba, “Atunywe Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu mkulu!” Want'hu wose wenulaga mikono yawe kulanga wakagamba, “Taile! Taile!” Naho want'hu wafikaga madi niyo wafunamizaga mitwi yawe hasi wakamvika Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Niyo wakimala kila mnt'hu hant'hu hakwe, Walawi wakutimila wawambizaga Waizilaeli vileke wakombaganye Imiko. Walawi awa ni Yeshua na Bani na Shelebia na Yamini na Akubu na Shabetai na Hodia na Maaseya na Kelita na Uzia na Yozabadi na Hanani na Pelaya. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Wasomaga vedi mwe kitabu che Miko ya Mnungu na kuwatambalisa vedi want'hu vileke wakombaganye kiya kiwandikwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Want'hu wose weze waive Imiko, wakongaga kuila. Nehemia uyo andaga kilongozi, na Ezila mlavant'hambiko naho mhinizi we miko, hamwenga na Walawi, wawahinizaga want'hu wakawagamba, “Mse kuila, Zuwa idi dikuka kwa Zumbe Mnungu, ywenyu, mse kuhongeza hegu kuila. <verse eid="NEH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Haluse uyeni kaya mkadamanye wila mdye vedi na kunywa divai yedi mna kumbukileni kuwenk'haga wadya heweena, kwaviya dyelo ni zuwa dikukile kwa Zumbe ywetu. Msekunda na kinyulu kwaviya kinyemi akuwenk'ha Zumbe Mnungu ni ludole kwenyu.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Ivo Walawi wawabasaga want'hu nakuwagamba waleke kuila, “Nyamaleni kwaviya zuwa dya dyielo ni zuwa dikukile msekunda na kinyulu.”<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Want'hu wose wauyaga kaya niyo wadya no kunywa kwa kinyemi na kuwenk'ha nk'hande watuhu kwaviya wakombaganyaga yose wagambilagwa.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuwa dya kinyemi dya viheha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Zuwa ditimile wakulu we zink'holo hamwenga na walavant'hambiko na Walawi waduganaga kwa Ezila uyo mhinizi ywe miko vileke wahine Imiko. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Wabunk'hulaga kugamba, Mwiko wa Mnungu uwo amwink'haga Musa wawaungaga want'hu wa Izilaeli wekale mwe viheha mwe dizuwa dya kinyemi che viheha cho mwezi wa mfungate. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Ivo wawagambilaga want'hu mwe mizi yose na uko Yelusalemu wakagamba, “Iteni kwe vigulu mkakant'he matambi yo mzeituni na mizaituni mbago na misingano na mitende na miti mituhu yo kuzengele viheha, enga ivo viwandikwe mwe miko.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Ivo want'hu wegalaga matambi na kuzenga viheha kila yumwenga mwe ditembe dyakwe, na mwo lwazo lwakwe, na ho lwazo lwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, na lwazo lwa want'hu wose hagihi ne Mwingilo wa Mazi ne mwingilo wa Efulaimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Want'hu wose wauyaga kulawa mwo utahigwa wazengaga viheha na kwikala umwo. Ino neinda nk'hanana ya nk'hongo want'hu kwikala mwe viheha kukongela mwa mazuwa ya Yeshua mwana Nuni. Want'hu wandaga na kinyemi kikulu.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Kukongela zuwa dya nk'hongo mpaka dyo uheelo Ezila awasomelaga want'hu kitabu che Miko ya Mnungu. Watendaga kinyemi icho kwa mazuwa mfungate na mwe dizuwa dyo mnane wadamanyaga mwivano wa kubindiliza kinyemi enga ivo iwandikwe mwo kitabu che miko.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Izilaeli wakweiila wavu wawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Mwe dizuwa dya milongo miidi na mine dyo mwezi wa mfungate, want'hu wa Izilaeli waduganaga, wakafunga na kuvala mavalo ya magunia na kukehaka luvumbi mwe mitwi yawe kulagisa kinyulu kwa wavu wawe wadamanye. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Mwo lupisi ulwo wandaga wakepagula hale na want'hu hiyo Wayahudi, wakimalaga na kweiila wavu wawe na wavu wa wakale wawe uwo wadamanyaga. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Wasomaga imiko ya Zumbe Mnungu kwa masaa matatu. Naho kwa masaa matatu matuhu wandaga wakakweiila na kumvika Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywawe. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Nokunda na kilingo kwajili ya Walawi aaho wakimalaga Yeshua na Bani na Kadimieli na Shebania na Buni na Shelebia na Bani na Kenani. Wakamlombeza Zumbe Mnungu ywawe kwa izwi kulu.<verse eid="NEH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Walawi awo ni Yeshua na Kadimieli na Bani na Hashabuea na Sherebia na Hodia na Shebania na Pesahia wawagambaga want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">“Kimaleni mumtogole Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Mtunyeni mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Kila yumwenga aditunye zina dyakwe dikukile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:5">Hamwenga na kugamba haihali nt'hogola yoyose ya kimnt'hu ikudaha kumwelela.”<verse eid="NEH 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa kweiila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ezila niyo alombeza akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">“Weye wikedu niwe Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">ni weye utendile mbingu ne zint'hondo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">si na bahali na vose vimndani mwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">naho weye niwe ukuvink'ha ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:6">na watumigwa wose wa kwe mbingu wafika madi na wafunamiza mitwi yawe hasi na kukuvika weye.”<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Weye ni we Zumbe Mnungu umsagule Abulamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">niyo wamlava kulawa Uli ya Wakalidayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:7">naho kumsakanyila zina tuhu niyo etangwa Ibulahimu.<verse eid="NEH 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Wamuona kunda mhuwilwa kwako, mhuwilwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">niyo waika Ndagano naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na kumlagana kuwenk'ha welekwa wakwe isi ya Wakanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na isi ya Wahiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na isi ya Waamoli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na isi ya Wapelezi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na isi ya Wayebusi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">na isi ya Wagiligashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">inde isi yawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:8">Nokukint'hiza kulagana kwako, kwaviya weye wi mhuwilwa.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />“Wayaonaga masulumizo ya wakale wetu umwo wandaga mwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:9">naho weze wakulombeze wambizi mwe bahali ya Shamu, wawategelezaga.<verse eid="NEH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Wadamanyaga vihungi na vilagiso mwa falao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">wandima wakwe wose na want'hu wose mwe isi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">kwaviya wamanyaga ivo wawasulumizaga wakale wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:10">Weye mwenye wakepatila nt'hunyo mpaka ivi dyelo.”<verse eid="NEH 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Waipangaga ibahali ha meso hawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">niyo woho wawombosa mgatigati mwe bahali hant'hu hanyaile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">Wawa duulaga Wamisili mwa mazi matali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:11">enga iwe dizamile dikudidimila mwe bahali.<verse eid="NEH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Nomsi nokuwalongoza kwa mnala wa vunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:12">nekilo kuwalongoza kwa mnala wa moto vileke uwazangazile sila yo kombokela.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Kudya kwo mnima Sinai waseelaga kulawa kwe mbingu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">na kulonga nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:13">niyo wawenk'ha malagizo yakuungwa, miko ya kindedi, na vihendo na sigilizi.<verse eid="NEH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Kwa kwombokela Musa mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:14">kuwahiniza kudimtoza dizuwa dikukile dya kuhumula na kuwenk'ha sigilizi, malagizo ne miko yako.<verse eid="NEH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />“Umwo wandaga na sala wawenk'haga nk'hande ikwitangwa mana kulawa kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Umwo wandaga na nk'hilu wawenk'haga mazi kulawa mwo luwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">Naho wawalagizaga waiguhe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:15">walaganaga kuwenk'ha.”<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Mna wakale wetu niyo wanda na weduvi na kunda wank'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:16">walemelaga kutimila sigilizi zako.<verse eid="NEH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Walemelaga kuzitimila naho wajala vihungi vose wadamanyaga kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">wandaga weduvi na kukesaguila kilongozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">ywa kuwavuza kwo utumwa uko Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu ukulekela masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">weye una mbazi na lukunde hiyo mhufu ywa maya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:17">Mbazi zako hezikulisa huwalekile.<verse eid="NEH 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Hata weze wakedamanyile hili dya kadama niyo wagamba niye Mnungu ywawe awalavile mwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:18">wakutendelaga wiihi utendese weye Zumbe.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Kwaviya weye una mbazi zitendese huwalekile kuwalongoza kudya kwe dijangwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">hwa uusaga mnala we divunde uwo wawalongozaga nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:19">hegu mnala wo moto kuwazangazila nekilo.<verse eid="NEH 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Naho kuwenk'ha muye ywako ywedi ywa kuwalangiliza ni kihi chedi cho kudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:20">niyo wakuwenk'ha nk'hande ikulawa kwe mbingu ikwitangwa mana na mazi yo kunywa.<verse eid="NEH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Wawalelaga vedi mwe dijangwa kwa lupisi lwa miyaka milongo mine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">naho hawaswesaga chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">suke zawe hazasakalaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:21">viga vawe navo havatutukaga.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Naho wawatendaga wawahume maseuta na want'hu wawe na si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">na isi, zihakane nawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">Waihumaga isi ya Heshiboni uko alongozaga seuta Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:22">naho waihumaga isi ya Bashani uko alongozaga seuta Ogu.<verse eid="NEH 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Wawatendaga welekwa wawe wande wabindile wingi enga nt'hondo zo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">na kuwegala mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:23">iyo alaganaga na wakale wawe kugamba naawenk'he.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Ivo, welekwa awo wezaga na kwikala mwe isi iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">wawahumaga wakaya we isi iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">niyo want'hu wawenk'ha udahi wa kuwatendela maseuta wa Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:24">na want'hu wawe, vovose ivo waungaga.<verse eid="NEH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Waitahaga mizi ina gomela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na kuiguha isi ina ulozo, mazumba yana ugoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">masima yasimbigwe, na nk'honde za mizaituni na mizabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">hamwenga ne miti ina matunda yabindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">wadyaga na kwiguta enga ivo waungaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:25">na kuonela kinyemi uwedi wako.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />“Mna hawandaga wahuwilwa kwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">Wakulekaga ne miko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">naho wawakomaga walotezi awo wandaga wakawakanya vileke wakuuwiye weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:26">Mna wakuhomola vitendese.”<verse eid="NEH 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Ivo niyo wawagela mwo udahi wa wank'hondo wawe woho nawo wasulumizwagwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Mna wandaga mwe masulumizo ayo, wakuiilaga vileke uwambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">weye niyo waweva kulawa kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">Naho kwa mbazi zako zitendese, wawegailaga vilongozi wa kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:27">niyo wakombolwa kulawa mwa wank'hondo wawe.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Mna utondowazi wize upatikane wadamanyaga wavu naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">weye nawe wawalekaga wank'hondo wawe wawekaile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Hata ivo weze wakweiile na kukulombeza wawayokolaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Uko kwe mbingu wawevaga nk'hanana zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:28">Wawayokolaga kwa mbazi zitendese.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Wawakanyaga watimile imiko yako na sigilizi zako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">Mna kwa weduvi wawe walekaga kuitimila imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">hata uneva kwa kutoza miko yako kwamtenda mnt'hu ekale vedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:29">woho wandaga wank'hani naho wadala walemelaga kutegeleza.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Wawafinyilizaga kwa miyaka mingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">na kuwakanya mwe sila yo muye ywako kwa kombokela walotezi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">hata ivo hawawategeleze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:30">Ivo wawalekaga watahigwe ni si nt'huhu.<verse eid="NEH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Hata ivo kwa mbazi zako zitendese, hwalekaga wabanike na kuwajala, kwaviya weye ni Zumbe Mnungu mta mbazi na uwedi.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />“We Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">watisa kwa ludole lwako!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">weye ywi mhuwilwa, kukint'hiza yadya ukilagane mwe ndagano yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">Kukongela mwo lupisi umwo maseuta wa Asilia wakakisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">mpaka ivi dielo,kisulumizisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">maseuta wetu, wakulu wetu, walavant'hambiko wetu, na walotezi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">na wakale wetu, na want'hu wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kukongela mwo useuta wa seuta wa Asilia</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">mpaka dyelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:32">kumbukila ivo kisulumizwe.<verse eid="NEH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Hata ivo una uwagilwa wa kukisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:33">kwaviya weye ywi mhuwilwa hamwenga na kugamba suwe kinda wadamanyi wo wavu.<verse eid="NEH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Maseuta wetu na wakulu wetu na walavant'hambiko wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">na wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">hawatozaga sigilizi zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:34">hawatimile miko yako na makanyo yako uwenk'hile.<verse eid="NEH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Hata umwo wandaga wakei mwo useuta wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">wakauonela kinyemi uwedi wako utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">mwe isi nk'hulu uwenk'hile ina ulozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:35">hawaungile kukuvika na kuleka sila zawe ziihile.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Mna kaula kinda watumwa dielo, watumwa mwe isi uwenk'hile wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:36">isi ina sanga yedi ikukink'ha ulozo.<verse eid="NEH 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Kwajili yo wavu wetu ugoli we isi ino waita kwa maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">wadya uwegale wakitendela ivo wakuunga kwajili yo wavu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">naho hata mifugwa yetu waitenda ivo wakuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NEH 9:37">naivo kimwe makunt'ho makulu!”<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wazumila kwivana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Kwajili ya aya yose yalaile, suwe Waizilaeli chaika ndagano itogile kwa kuwandika na wakulu wetu, Walawi na walavant'hambiko waika kiwalo na uwona.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Ywa nk'hongo kugela kiwalo andaga Nehemia mkulu ywo mkowa, niyo atimila Hakalila na Sedekia. <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Walavant'hambiko wageile kiwalo mwe ndagano iyo ni, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Selaya, Uzia na Yelemia, <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Pashuli, Amalia na Makiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Hatushi, Shebania na Maluki,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:5">Halimu, Melemothi na, Obadia, <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Danieli, Ginesoni na Baluku, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meshulamu, Abiya na Miyamini, <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maazia, Biligai na Shemaya.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Naho mazina ya walawi ni aya. Yeshua mwana wa Azania na Binui ywo lukolo lwa Henadadi na Kadimieli, <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />walawi watuhu ni Shebania, Hodia, Kelita Pelaya na Hanani, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rehobu na Hashabia, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakuli, Shelebia na Shebania, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodia, Bani na Beninu. <verse eid="NEH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Aya nayo mazina ye vilongozi wa Waizilaeli wageile viwalo, Paloshi na Pahati uyo ywe dikabila dya Moabu, Elamu na Zatu na Bani. <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni, Azigadi na Bebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya, Bigwai na Adini, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ateli, Hezekia, Azuli, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodia, Hashumu na Bezai, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Halifu, Anatoti na Nebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magipiashi, Meshulamu na Hezili, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabeli, Sadoki na Yadua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatia, Hanani na Anaya, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoshea, Hanania na Hashubu, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheshi, Piliha na Shobeki, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Lehumu, Hashabina na Maaseya, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahia, Hanani na Anani, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluki, Halimu na Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli waika maivano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Suwe wose want'hu wa Izilaeli, walavant'hambiko na Walawi, wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu na wakemi na wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu na want'hu wose wakeikile hale na want'hu hiyo Wayahudi, vileke wazitoze sigilizi za Mnungu, wakanda hamwenga na wavele wawe na wana wawe na wose wakudaha kukombaganya, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />chalungana na wandugu zetu na wakulu wetu mwe kilapi. Hakina timile kilapi iki nekiligitwe, naho chaika kilapi kugamba nekikale kwa kutimila sigilizi za Mnungu izo akisigiile kwombokela Musa mndima ywakwe. Naho nekizumile yose ayo Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu akisigile.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Wana kike wetu hekiwaloze mwa want'hu wa si ino hegu wana wetu hawalombe kwawe.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Uneva want'hu wa si nt'huhu wanegala nk'hande hegu chochose cha kutaga mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula hegu zuwa dyodyose dikukile, suwe hekigule kwawe. Kila ikabula mwaka wa mfungate, hekiilime isanga naho kila mtigizo nouuswe.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />Chakeikila sigilizi kugamba kwa mwaka nekilave gilamu ya masawa kwaajili ye Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu.<verse eid="NEH 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Iviya iviya nekilave, mikate ikukile na malavo na unga kila zuwa na malavo yo kokwa na malavo ya zuwa dyo kuhumula, mazuwa ye kinyemi cho mwandamo wo mnenge na malavo kwajili ya mazuwa matuhu ye kinyemi, ziikigwe, na vint'hu vituhu vikukile, malavo ya kuusa wavu vileke kuwadamanyila mwivano want'hu wa Izilaeli, na kila kikuungwa mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu ywetu.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Suwe wose na walavant'hambiko na Walawi Nekitowe simbi kila mwaka vileke kisagule lukolo nolwigale nk'huni za kokela nt'hambiko mwe kilingo cha Zumbe Mnungu viligane ne sigilizi.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Chazumila kwigala kila mwaka ulozo wetu wa nk'hongo ya matunda ya kila miti kwe Nyumba ya Munungu.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Nekigale kila nt'hulasasu ywe kilume, mwe kaya zetu, mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu ywetu kwa walavant'hambiko wakudamanya ndima uumwo vileke akaikwe kwajili ya Mnungu. Naho nekigale kila mwaka nt'hulasasu ye ng'ombe na mbuzi na ngoto zetu,Viligane na ivo iwandikwe sigilizi.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Kila unga wa nk'hongo na malavo yetu na matunda ye miti na divai na mavuta nekiviigale kwa mlavant'hambiko mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu ywetu. Naho nekigale fungu dyo mlongo mwo ulozo wetu kwa Walawi, kwaviya ni woho wakudamanya ndima na kuduganya fungu dyo mlongo mwe zikaya zetu. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Mlavant'hambiko mwelekwa ywa Haluni naande hamwenga na Walawi wakahokela fungu dyo mlongo. Akajika Walawi nawegale imwenga ya mlongo ye difungu idyo dyo mlongo dilavigwe mwe vyumba va kuikila vint'hu mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli na Walawi nawayegale malavo ya unga na divai na mavuta ye mizeituni mwe vyumba umwo vikuikwa vint'hu vikukile. Na aho walavant'hambiko we mwo luzo na wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu na wakemi wakwikala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:39">“Naho mazuwa yose nekiikaulise Nyumba ya Mnungu ywetu.”<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Want'hu wekalaga Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Vilongozi wa want'hu nawakekala mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu, mzi ukukile. Want'hu tuhu wasigale kulawa mwe mizi ya Yuda na Benjamini watowaga simbi wasagule mp'huga imwenga imwenga kulawa mwe kila mp'huga mlongo iite ikekale mwo mzi ukukile wa Yelusalemu, lupisi uulo zimp'huga zint'huhu zisigale nezinda zikale mwe mizi mp'huga kenda zekalaga mwe mizi yawe mituhu. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Want'hu wose nawa mlombeza Mnungu awavikile wadya waungaga wenye kwikala mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Mwe mizi mituhu want'hu wa Izilaeli na walavant'hambiko na Walawi na wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu na welekwa wa Selemani, wekalaga kwawe kwe mizi yawe wenye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:3">Aya nayo mazina ye vilongozi wa majimbo wekalaga Yelusalemu <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Wamwenga mwa want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini na Yuda wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Wo lukolo lwa Yuda wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu ni. Atahaya elekwe ni Uzia, uzia elekwe ni Zekalia, Zakalia elekwe ni Amalia, Amalia elekwe ni Shefatia, Shefatia elekwe ni Mahalaleli. Wose awa ni welekwa wa Pelesi.<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Naho Maaseya elekwe ni Baluku, baluku elekwe ni Kolihoze. Na wakale wakwe watuhu ni hamwenga na Hazaya na Adaya na Yoyalibu na Zakalia ywe mp'huga ikulawa Shilo.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Welekwa wose wa Pelesi wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu wandaga wagosi watowani wadahi magana mane na milongo mtandatu na mnane.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Want'hu wa lukolo lwa Benjamini wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu ni Salu, mwana Meshulamu, mwezukuluwe ywa Yoedi. Na wakale wakwe watuhu ni hamwenga na Pedaya mwana Kolaya, Kolaya mwana Maaseya, Maaseya mwana Itieli, Itieli mwana Yeshaya. <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Watuhu wandaga Gabi na Salai wandugu wa hagihi wa Salu. Uwazilo wawe wandaga magana kenda na milongo miidi na mnane. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoeli mwana Zikili niye andaga kilongozi ywawe Yuda naye mwana wa Hasenua andaga kilongozi ywa kaidi wo mzi.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Walava nt'hambiko wekalaga mzi wa Yelusalemu wandaga, Yedaya, mwana wa Yoalibu na Yakini,<verse eid="NEH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Selaya mwana wa Hiilkia, mwana wa Meshulamu, Na wakale wakwe ni hamwenga na Sadoki mwana wa Melayoti, Meloti mwana wa Ahitubu uyo andaga mlavant'hiko mkulu ywe Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />Want'hu awo hamwenga na ndugu zawe wadamanyaga ndima mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu, wandaga want'hu magana mnane na milongo miidi na mbili, hamwenga na awo kwandaga na Adaya, mwana Yelohamu, mwana wa Pelalia. Amisi mwana wa Zekalia, Zekalia mwana wa Pashuli, Pashuli mwana wa Makiya. <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />Naho kwandaga na ndugu zawe wakulu mwa wakale wawe wose kwa hamwenga wandaga want'hu magana maidi na milongo mine na mbili. Na mlava nt'hambiko mtuhu ekalaga yelusalemu ni Amasai, mwana wa Azaleli, mwana wa Ahazai, Uzia mwana wa Meshilemoti, Meshiloti mwana wa Imeli. <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />Kwandaga na wandugu zawe gana dimwenga na milongo miidi na mnane, wandaga watowani wadahi, mkulu ywawe andaga Zabidieli mwana Hagedolimu. <verse eid="NEH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Walawi wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu wandaga ni Shemaya elekwe ni Hashubu, Ashibu elekwe ni Azilikamu, Wakale wakwe wandaga ni Hashabia na Buni.<verse eid="NEH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Shabetai na Yozabadi wandaga vilongozi wa Walawi, wandaga wakimalizi we ndima za kuse ye Nyumba ya Mnungu.<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Matania mwana Mika na mwezukuluwe dya Zabidi na mwelekwa ywa Asafu alongozaga wakemi kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu wakakema mila ya kulombeza na kumtogola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:17">Bakubukia andaga mwambizi ywakwe, hamwenga na awo wandaga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 11:17">Abida mwana Shamu mwana wa Galali mwelekwa ywa Yedutuni.<verse eid="NEH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Walawi wose wekalaga mwo mzi ukukile wa Yelusalemu, wandaga magana maidi na milongo mnane na wane. <verse eid="NEH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Wamizi we zink'hili wekalaga Yelusalemu wandaga, Akubu na Talimoni hamwenga na wandugu zawe wandaga wakamila Zink'hili wandaga gana dimwenga na milongo mfungate na waidi.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Want'hu watuhu wa Izilaeli, na walavant'hambiko na Walawi wekalaga mwe mizi ya Yuda, kila yumwenga apangilwagwa hant'hu hakwe. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Mna wandima we Nyumba ya Mnungu wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu hant'hu hakwitangwa Ofeli wakakimailwa ni Ziha na Gishipa.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Kilongozi ywa Walawi ekalaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu andaga ni Uzi mwana Bani, Bani mwana wa Hashabia, Hashabia mwana wa Matania, Matania mwana Mika ywo lukolo lwa Asafu, wenk'wagwa ndima ya ukemi mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Seuta alavaga sigilizi mwe mitendele ye zindima zawe na yadya nawakayaunga kwa kila zuwa.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahia mwana Meshezabedi ywo lukolo lwa Zela mwe dikabila dya Yuda, andaga mlongi ywe zimbuli zose za seuta kwa want'hu wa Yuda.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu mwe mizi mituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Want'hu wamwenga wekalaga mwe mizi hagihi ne zink'honde zawe, watuhu nawo we dikabila dya Yuda wekalaga Kiliati Aliba na Diboni na Yekabizeeli hamwenga ne zikaya zizunguluke. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Watuhu wekalaga mwo mzi wa Yeshua na Molada na Bet Peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />na Hasali Shuali na Beel Sheba hamwenga ne zikaya zikuwazunguluka mizi iyo . <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Watuhu wekalaga mwe zikaya za Zikilagi na Mekona ne zikaya zikuwazunguluka. <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Watuhu nawo wekalaga mwe mizi ya Enilimoni na Zola na Yalimuti, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />na Zanoa na Adulamu hamwenga ne zikaya zikuwazunguluka mizi iyo na Lakishi na nk'honde ikuwazunguluka, no Mzi wa Azeka hamwenga ne zikaya zikuwazunguluka. Nuko kugamba want'hu wa Yuda wekalaga hagati ya kwa mwenye mzi mwa Beel Sheba na Mkoma mahanya ye dikolongo dya Hinomu.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Want'hu wa Benjamini wekalaga Geba na Mikimashi na Ai na Beteli ne zikaya zakwe, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />na Anoti na Nobu na Anania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hazoli na Lama na Gitimu, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadidi, Seboimu na Nebalati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lodi na Ono na mwe dikolongo dya wakudamanya vint'hu vihengi.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Walawi wamwenga wakalaga Yuda wegalwagwa wakekale hamwenga na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Ludongo lwa Walavant'hambiko na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Ukutimila ni ludongo lwa walavant'hambiko na Walawi wauyaga kulawa kwo utahigwa hamwenga na Zelubabeli mwana Shealtieli na mlavant'hambiko mkulu Yeshua.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:1">Walavant'hambiko awa ni Selaya, Yelemia na Ezila, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amalia, Maluki, Hatushi <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekania, Lehumu na Melemoti, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido, Ginetoni na Abiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamini, Maadia na Biligai, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya, Yoyalibu na Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu na Amoki na Hilikia na Yedaya, awo wandaga ni vilongozi wa walavant'hambiko na wandugu zawe umwo Yeshua andaga mlavant'hambiko mkulu.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Lukolo lwa Walawi wauiye ni hamwenga na Yeshua na Binui na Kadimieli na Shelebia na Yuda na Matania wandaga wakimalizi wo ukemi we nt'hogola wakanda na wanduguze. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Na awo Bakukia na Uno na Walawi weyawe, wakimalaga hagihi na woho wakazumila mwo ukemi.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa mlavant'hambiko mkulu Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yoshua amwelekaga Yoakimu na Yoakimu amwelekaga Eliashibu na Eliashibu amwelekaga Yoyada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada amwelekaga Yonasani na Yonasani amwelekaga Yadua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu we zink'holo za walavant'hambiko,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Yoakimu eze ande mlavant'hambiko mkulu, walavant'hambiko wakutimila wandaga wakulu we zink'holo zawe, Uyo Melaya wa lukolo lwa Selaya na Hanania kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Yelemia <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Meshulam kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Ezila, Yehohanani kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Amalia, <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Yonasani kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Maluki, Yosefu kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Shebania, <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Adina kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Halimu, Hekai kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Melayoti, <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Zekalia kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Ido, Meshulamu kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Ginetoni, <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Zikli kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Abiya, naho kwandaga na kilongozi kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Miniamini; Piltai kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Moadia, <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Shamua kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Biligai, Yehonatani kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Shemaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Matenai kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Yoalibu, Uzi kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Yedaya, <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Kalai kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Salai, Ebeli kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Amoki, <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Heshabia kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Hilikia, Netaneli, kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Yedaia,<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mp'huga za Walavant'hambiko na Walawi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Umwo Eliashibu na Yoyada na Yohanani na Yadua wakulu wa walavant'hambiko kwandaga na ludongo lwa wakulu wa mp'huga za walava nt'hambiko na Walawi, ludongo ulwo lwaheelaga mwo ulongozi wa seuta Dalio. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Wakulu we zimp'huga za Walawi kwavovose wawandikwagwa mwe kitabu che nk'humbukila mpaka mwo lupisi lwa Yohasani mwezukuluwe ywa Eliashibu.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipangile ye zindima mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Awa nawo vilongozi we zink'holo naho welekwa wa Lawi: Hashabia na Shelebia na Yoshua mwana Kadimieli, na watuhu wakepangile mwe mafyo maidi, mafyo ayo yandaga yakasinyana umwo yakamtogola Mnungu na kumtunya kwa kuhokelana, wadamanyaga ivo viligane ne miko ya seuta Daudi mnt'hu ywa Mnungu.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Wamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu wandaga: Matanuia na Bakibukia na Obadia na Meshulamu na Talimoni na Akubi, naho wandaga wamizi we vyumba vo kuikila vint'hu hadya he Zink'hili. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Want'hu awo wekalaga mwo lupisi lwa Yoakimu mwana Yoshua na mwezukuluwe Yosadaki naho mwo lupisi lwa Nehemia andaga mkulu we isi, na hata mwo lupisi lwa Ezila mlavant'hambiko mhinizi ywe Miko.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemia alwiika Lukazi kunda lwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Niyo mwo lupisi lwo kuluvikila lukazi lwa Yelusalemu, Walawi wegalwagwa kulawa kila hant'hu aho wekalaga weze Yelusalemu kunda hamwenga mwe kinyemi cho kuvikila lukazi, wakeme mila ya nt'hogola kwa kutowa mazeze na lupatu na vilangu. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Welekwa wa wakemi wakeduganyaga kulawa mwe nt'hendelo zose za Yelusalemu na kaya zakwe za Wanetofati, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />naho kulawa Beti Giligali, nt'hendelo ya Geba na Azamaweti kwaviya wakemi wakezengelaga kaya mnk'handa mwa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Walavant'hambiko na Walawi wakekukiza kwajili ya kumvika Mnungu hamwenga na kuwakukiza awant'hu ne zink'hili no lukazi.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Nehiwaduganya vilongozi wose wa Yuda mnanga mwo lukazi na kuika kunda vilongozi wa mafyo maidi makulu ya wakemi kuuzunguluka mzi kwa kinyemi, fyo dya nk'hongo nedihinga kulume yo lukazi na tuhu dihinga mwe Nk'hili ye Nt'hagata. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Wakemi awo watimilwagwa ni Hoshaya akanda ne nusu ye vilongozi wa Yuda, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />kunyuma kwawe watimilwagwa ni walavant'hambiko wandaga wakatowa magunda awo wakina Uzia na Ezila na Meshulamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />na Yuda na Benjamini na Shemaya na Yelemia. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Watimilwagwa ni walavant'hambiko wakina Zekalia, mwana wa Yonasani, mwezukuluwe dya Shemaya. Wakale wawe ni hamwenga na Matania na Mikaya na Zakuri wo lukolo lwa Asafu. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Kunyuma kwakwe atimilwagwa ni wanduguze wo lukolo lwa Zekalia awo wakina, Shemaya na Azaleli na Milalai na Gilalai na Maai na Netanieli na Yuda na Hanani. Awo wose wandaga wakatowa vint'hu va kukemela enga viya andaga akatowa seuta Daudi mndima ywa Mnungu. Ezila Mhinizi ywe Miko niye alongozaga difyo idyo. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Mwe Nk'hili ye Zinc'hoko wakwelaga mwe vibo kuhinga kwo mzi wa Daudi, wajink'haga Nyumba ye kiseuta ya Daudi na kuuuya mpaka kwo lukazi kwe Nk'hili ya Mazi ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Fyo tuhu dikemile ukemi we nt'hogola na kumtunya nedihinga nt'hendelo ya kumoso mnanga mwe lukazi. Miye natimilana ne difyo idi hamwenga ne nusu ya want'hu. Chombokaga mwo Mnala we Nunda mpaka kwe lukazi luzangalamke. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Na kulawa aaho chombokaga kwe nk'hili ya Efulaimu ne nk'hili ya Yeshana, ne Nk'hili ya Samaki, no Mnala wa Hananeli na Mnala wa Gana dimwenga mpaka kwe Nk'hili ya Ngoto. Chabindaga utafi wetu hagihi ne Nk'hili ya Wamizi.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Ivo mafyo yose maidi yandaga yakakema ukemi we nt'hogola yakimalaga mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu hamwenga na miye ne nusu ye vilongozi. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Iviya iviya walavant'hambiko wandile wakatoa magunda awo wakina Elikana na Maaseya, Miniamini, Mikaya, Eliehoenai, Zekalia na Hanania, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />awo watimilagwa na Maaseya na Shemaya, Eleazali, Uzi, Yehohanani, Makiya, Elamu na Ezeli. Wakemi wakemaga wakalongozwa na Yezilahia naho nawakakema kwa izwi kulu. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Zuwa idyo want'hu walavaga nt'hambiko zitendese na kunda na kinyemi kwaviya Mnungu awatendaga wande na kinyemi kikulu. Naho wavele na wana wose wandaga na kinyemi na kutoa nk'helegele za kinyemi. Maizwi yao kulawa mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu yagendesaga hale.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavo kwajili ya mviko mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Mwo lupisi ludya wasagulwagwa wakimalizi we vyumba vo kuikila malavokwajili ye Nyumba ya Mnungu, yakanda ni hamwenga na imwenga ya mlongo, ulozo wa nk'hongona ulozo wa kila mwaka. Want'hu awa nawo wandaga nd ndima yo kuvidugunya vint'hu ivo kulawa mwe zink'honde zimgihi na mizi ihengi, malavo kwajili ya walavant'hambiko,na Walawi viligane ne Miko. Want'hu wose wa Yuda welelwagwa kwe zindima zose zandile zikadamanywa ni walavant'hambiko, <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />umwo wandile wakadamanya vint'hu va kuwatenda zumilwe kumvika Mnungu enga ivo wadamanye wakemi na wamizi we nk'hili viligane na malagizo yaikagwa ni seuta Daudi na seuta Selemani uyo mwanawe. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Kukongela mwo lupisi lwa seuta Daudi na mkemi Asafu, wakemi walongozaga ukemi wa kumtunya na nt'hogola kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Mwo lupisi lwa Zulubabeli na Nehemia want'hu wose wa Izilaeli walavaga mageleko ya kwambiza wakemi na wamizi we nk'hili, naho want'hu niyo walava mageleko yawe yakukile kwa walawi, walawi nao waikaga hank'handa fungu dya mlongo na kuwenk'ha walavant'hambiko awo welekwa wa Haluni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wawapagula Want'hu hiyo Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Mwe dizuwa idyo dye kinyemi, kitabu cha Musa nekisomigwa kwa izwi kulu ha want'hu niyo waona hant'hu hakugamba, Waamoni na Wamoabu wasekulungana na want'hu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Ino ni kwaviya want'hu wa Izilaeli umwo wandaga wakatamba kulawa Misili kuita Kanaani. Waamoni na Wamoabu hawawenk'haga nk'hande na mazi, vituhu vakwe wamfumbasaga Balaamu vileke awaligite Waizilaeli. Mna Mnungu ywetu ahitulaga diligito kunda uvikilwa. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli weze weve Umwiko uwo hawakehanganyaga na want'hu hiyo Wayahudi.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemia uviki we kindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Zuwa dye kinyemi umo dyandaga hadinati, mlavant'hambiko Eliashibu uyo andaga kasagulwa akaule vyumba ve Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu ywetu, andaga na umbuya na Tobia uyo andaga mnk'hondo ywetu. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Eliashabu amlekelaga Tobia chumba kikulu icho aho nk'hongo chandaga chakuikila nt'hambiko na nk'hande na ubani na vyombo na divai na fungu dya mlongo na mavuta na vint'hu ivo walagizagwa kuwenk'ha Walawi na wakemi na waamizi we Nyumba ya Mnungu na malavo kwa walavant'hambiko. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Umwo aya yakalaila miye hyandaga Yelusalemu kwaviya mwo mwaka wa milongo mitatu na mbili wo useuta wa Atashasta wa Babeli, nehiuya kwa seuta vileke hamgambile yalaile. Mazuwa mageke kulongole namlombezaga seuta vileke niuye naho Yelusalemu, naye niyo anizumila. <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Nize niuye Yelusalemu naho nabunk'hulaga wiihi wa Elishibu wa kumwink'ha chumba Tobia mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Nehiihiwa vitendese na kuviduula kuse vint'hu vote va Tobia. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Niyo nasigiila want'hu, woho niyo wavitendaga ivyumba ivo vizumilwe kwa ndima ya Mnungu, name niyo navuza naho vint'hu va mwe Nyumba ya Mnungumalavo ya unga no ubani.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Naho niyo nabunk'hula kugamba wakemi na Walawi watuhu wahalawa Yelusalemu na kuuya kwe zink'honde zawe kwaviya want'hu wa Izilaeli hawawenk'hile nk'hande na vint'hu vikuungwa kwa wikazi wawe. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Nawakanyaga vilongozi hagamba, “Nii Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu ilekigwa?” Nawaduganyaga Walawi na wakemi wauye kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu na kudamanya ndima zawe. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Niyo want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wakonga naho kwigala fungu dya mlongo dya unga na divai na mavuta ya mizeituni mwe vindolo. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Nawasagula want'hu wande wakaulizi we vindolo. Mlavant'hambiko Shelemia na Sadoki mhinizi ywe miko na Pedaia ywe dikabila dya Lawi, na Hanani mwana Zakuli na mwezukuluwe Matania ande mnt'hu ywa kuwambiza. Want'hu awa wandaga wahuwilwa mwe ndima yawe yandaga ni kuwapangila wandima weyawe icho wakuunga.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu, unikumbukile kwajili ya aya yose no wedi nidamanye mwe Nyumba yako na kwajili yo undima wako.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Mwo lupisi ulwo nawaonaga want'hu wa Yuda wakakama zabibu zuwa dyo kuhumula. Naho watuhu wandaga wakakweza nt'hanu mwe zimp'hunda zawe unga, divai na zabibu na tini na vint'hu vituhu wavigalaga kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Nakuwakanya kugamba hawakuungwa kutaga vint'hu ivo mwe Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Want'hu watuhu kulawa mwo mzi wa Tilo wekalaga Yelusalemu, wegalaga samaki na vint'hu vituhu mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu na kuwatagila want'hu wetu Zuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Nawakanyaga vilongozi wa Yuda hagamba wavu wani uno mkuudamanya, “Mwaditenda Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula kunda hadikukile? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Togoleni wakale wetu hawadamanyaga wavu enga uno na kumtenda Mnungu ywetu akibanane hamwenga no mzi uno? Naho mkei mwegala ubanangi mwe Izilaeli kwa kudibalanga Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Ivo niyo nalagiza kugamba zink'hili zose zo mzi wa Yelusalemu zivugalwe umwo Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula dikakonga, ziza dikakonga kwingila, naho sema yanakomolwe mpaka zuwa dyo kuvika dikajink'ha. Nehiwaika want'hu wangu mwe zink'hili na kuwalagiza kugamba kint'hu chochose sema kinaletigwe mwo mzi mwe Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Kaidi hegu katatu, wachuuzi ndaga wakachuuza vint'hu vi hengi yawaungaga wagone kuse yo mzi mwe Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula dikanda dikei kukonga. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Nehiwakanya hawagamba, “Hiyo vedi kugona kuse yo mzi, mna uiya naho neniwagwileni.” Ivo kukongela zuwa idyo hawauyaga naho mwe Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Nehiwalagiza Walawi wakekukize wakamile kwe nk'hili vileke Dizuwa dyo Kuhumula dinde dikukile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Mnungu ywangu unikumbukile hata kwa idi, unionele mbazi viligane no lukunde lwako lukulise.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Naho nabunk'hulaga kugamba Wayahudi walomba wavele kulawa Ashidodi na Amoni na Moabu, <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />ne nusu ya wana wawe wandaga wakalonga ulosi wa Kiashidodi hamwenga aha walonga ulosi wa want'hu watuhu, naho hawadahaga kulonga ulosi wa Kiibulania. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Nehiwakanya na kuwaligita mpaka wamwenga wawe nawatowaga na kuwachutula fili zawe na kuwatigiza wakelise kwa zina dya Mnungu ywawe kugamba wasekuwaloza naho wana kike wawe hegu wakilume kwa wana wa want'hu hi Wayahudi hegu du hata nyuwe wenye. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Nagambaga, “Togoleni! Selemani hadamanyaga wavu kwajili ya wavele we hengi? Yehe nakanda seuta mkulu kujink'ha maseuta watuhu wa si nt'huhu. Mnungu amuungaga na kumtenda kunda seuta ywa want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, hata ivo wavele wa si nt'huhu wamtendaga adamanye wavu. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Togoleni! Kitimile mliganyizo wenyu kidamanye wavu uno mkulu wa kuleka kumzumila Mnungu ywetu, kwa kulomba wavele wa watakwiza?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Yumwenga mwa wana wa Yoyada uyo andaga mwana Eliyashibu mlavant'hambiko mkulu, amlombaga mwana kike ywa Sanibalati kulawa mwo mzi wa Beti Haloni, kwaivo namgulusaga Yoyada ahalawe kuse ya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />We Mnungu! Kumbukila want'hu ivo wageile usavu ulavant'hambiko ne Ndagano wiikile na walavant'hambiko na Walawi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Nehiwakukiza want'hu kulawa mwe ivint'hu viihile va watakwiza. Niyo naika ve imitendele kwajili ya walavant'hambiko na Walawi vileke kila yumwenga amanye indima yakwe. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Nehiwapanga want'hu wo kwigala nk'huni zo kokela malavo he kilingo zigalwe kwa lupisi lukuungwa, naho want'hu wegale malavo ya fungu dya mlongo no ulozo wa nk'hongo mwo lupisi lukuungwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">We Mnungu ywangu, unikumbukile kwa aya yose naho unink'he uwagilwa wako.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>